    "detailed_description": "NightShift is an anime inspired stylish action drifting game with RPG elements. Buy parts, tune, and drift through a collection of mountain roads to become the new &quot;Ice King&quot; of Santa Vista.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562360/extras/7e1673b8817d0e47bac93384ca684640.avif?t=1749141571\" data-has-big /></span><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Explore a fully drivable 2.5D Open World</strong> - Explore the city of Santa Vista, learning about the history and culture of the people that live there!<br></li><li><strong>Work your job?</strong> - Help a myriad of ridiculous customers through a variety of mini-games as you make money to spend on your car.<br></li><li><strong>Drift through 4 playable Mountain Roads</strong> - Wind your way down (and up!) mastering each track, becoming the best driver in the city!<br></li><li><strong>Become the Ice-King</strong> - Challenge over 15 unique drivers and earn the respect of the Santa Vista Drifting Scene.<br></li><li><strong>Customizable Cars</strong>  - Make your car your own through our custom Tuning System which allows you to modify almost everything on your car<br></li><li><strong>Split Screen Local and Online Multiplayer</strong> - 1v1 friends and foes alike in split-screen local or online multiplayer</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "NightShift is an anime inspired stylish action drifting game with RPG elements. Buy parts, tune, and drift through a collection of mountain roads to become the new &quot;Ice King&quot; of Santa Vista.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2562360/extras/7e1673b8817d0e47bac93384ca684640.avif?t=1749141571\" data-has-big /></span><br><strong>Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Explore a fully drivable 2.5D Open World</strong> - Explore the city of Santa Vista, learning about the history and culture of the people that live there!<br></li><li><strong>Work your job?</strong> - Help a myriad of ridiculous customers through a variety of mini-games as you make money to spend on your car.<br></li><li><strong>Drift through 4 playable Mountain Roads</strong> - Wind your way down (and up!) mastering each track, becoming the best driver in the city!<br></li><li><strong>Become the Ice-King</strong> - Challenge over 15 unique drivers and earn the respect of the Santa Vista Drifting Scene.<br></li><li><strong>Customizable Cars</strong>  - Make your car your own through our custom Tuning System which allows you to modify almost everything on your car<br></li><li><strong>Split Screen Local and Online Multiplayer</strong> - 1v1 friends and foes alike in split-screen local or online multiplayer</li></ul>",
